# Large file sidecar policy
#
# Managed by automations/agent-standards. An edit between these markers is
# overwritten by the next sync; change agent-standards/large-file-extensions.txt
# instead.
#
# Binaries in these formats belong in the Noygear Shared Drive with a Markdown
# sidecar committed here in their place. See the large-file storage section of
# AGENTS.md. Files this repo already tracks are unaffected, because .gitignore
# does not untrack anything. To add one deliberately, `git add -f <path>`. The
# pre-commit guard in guards.d/ is the hard block and refuses only files over its
# size threshold, so a force-added screenshot still goes through.
#
# The bracketed spelling covers SCAN.PDF and IMG_1234.JPG as well as the lower
# case forms. Git matches .gitignore case-sensitively wherever the filesystem is,
# which includes Linux and CI, while the guard lowercases before matching. Plain
# `*.pdf` would leave the two disagreeing about exactly those names.
#
# This block is written at the top of the file. Everything this repo owns goes
# below it, where git's last-match-wins rule means it takes precedence. To keep
# one binary that a line here would otherwise ignore, add an exception below,
# such as `!fixtures/sample.pdf`, and say why.
*.[mM][pP]4
*.[mM][oO][vV]
*.[mM]4[vV]
*.[aA][vV][iI]
*.[mM][kK][vV]
*.[wW][eE][bB][mM]
*.[wW][aA][vV]
*.[mM][pP]3
*.[mM]4[aA]
*.[aA][aA][cC]
*.[aA][iI][fF]
*.[aA][iI][fF][fF]
*.[fF][lL][aA][cC]
*.[pP][nN][gG]
*.[jJ][pP][gG]
*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
*.[hH][eE][iI][cC]
*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]
*.[gG][iI][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF][fF]
*.[pP][sS][dD]
*.[aA][iI]
*.[fF][iI][gG]
*.[sS][kK][eE][tT][cC][hH]
*.[pP][dD][fF]
*.[dD][oO][cC]
*.[dD][oO][cC][xX]
*.[dD][oO][cC][mM]
*.[oO][dD][tT]
*.[xX][lL][sS]
*.[xX][lL][sS][xX]
*.[xX][lL][sS][mM]
*.[xX][lL][sS][bB]
*.[oO][dD][sS]
*.[pP][pP][tT]
*.[pP][pP][tT][xX]
*.[pP][pP][tT][mM]
*.[pP][pP][sS]
*.[pP][pP][sS][xX]
*.[oO][dD][pP]
*.[zZ][iI][pP]
*.7[zZ]
*.[rR][aA][rR]
*.[tT][aA][rR]
*.[gG][zZ]
*.[dD][mM][gG]
*.[eE][xX][eE]
*.[mM][sS][iI]
*.[oO][nN][nN][xX]
*.[pP][tT]
*.[pP][tT][hH]
*.[sS][aA][fF][eE][tT][eE][nN][sS][oO][rR][sS]
# End large file sidecar policy

